        <mxCell id="legend-text" value="• Hub templates ({{hub...hub}}) allow policies running on managed clusters to read data from the hub cluster&#xa;• ManagedClusterView provides a &quot;window&quot; from hub into managed cluster resources&#xa;• ConfigMap acts as an intermediary - hub aggregates data, active cluster consumes it&#xa;• Label-based filtering (volsync-role=destination-info) enables dynamic cluster discovery" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
